\doxysubsection{Detailed Description}
Main program entry point. 

Handles command line arguments and initiates sorting

Usage\+: program input\+\_\+file output\+\_\+file field\+\_\+num algo\+\_\+num
\begin{DoxyItemize}
\item field\+\_\+num\+: 1=string, 2=integer, 3=float
\item algo\+\_\+num\+: 1=merge sort, 2=quicksort 
\end{DoxyItemize}

